  "story": {
    "day": 62,
    "title": "Kaya's Market Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was a happy girl.",
      "Her family went to a new market.",
      "Many people come to this place.",
      "A kind lady showed long bamboo shoots.",
      "A man, who was famous, sold cucumbers.",
      "They also saw a small building that was a library.",
      "Kaya didn't know if it had books about London.",
      "\"Who's that?\" asked her dear mother.",
      "They bought a crab from a low tank, or some fish.",
      "It was the right choice, not a bad one.",
      "At home, Kaya helped wash the vegetables and put them away.",
      "She loved to bathe in our warm bath water."
    ]
  }
}